            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does this portable charger have built-in charging cables?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. This power bank with built-in retractable cables includes two 25.6-inch retractable charging cables. Simply pull to extend and release to retract automatically, keeping your bag or pocket free from tangled cables.</p>",
